# The image expects a pre-staged `linux-<arch>/alint` from the
# release workflow — everything else is context bloat.
*
!linux-amd64/alint
!linux-arm64/alint
# License + attribution shipped in the image (see Dockerfile). LICENSE-* and
# NOTICE are committed at the repo root; THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.html is downloaded
# into the context by the release workflow's docker job (supply-chain artifact).
!LICENSE-APACHE
!LICENSE-MIT
!NOTICE
!THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.html
